C-551 -> researcher status verified.\nT2/verified -> route HR-2.\nHR-2 -> handling notice HN-12.\nAll six leaves are open and current.\n\nUNIT INVENTORY\nU-09: conservation flag CF-2; status active; added 2026-08-30 after the stable-condition grade dated 2026-08-12. No physical or digital surrogate exists for U-09.\nU-09X: no conservation flag; a digital surrogate exists. This is a different unit.\n\nACCESS CONDITIONS\nHN-12 permits supervised reading-room delivery when no later active restriction applies. Any active CF flag withholds the original from reading-room delivery until conservation clears it. When such a flag applies and a surrogate exists, only the surrogate is delivered. When no surrogate exists, the request waits for conservation clearance. An unverified reader is denied access regardless of handling tier.\n\nNEAR-MATCH RECORDS\nT2/verified-OLD -> route HR-1 -> notice HN-10; withdrawn 2026-07-01. Its terminal rule allows supervised delivery.\nT2/unverified -> route HR-4 -> notice HN-14; current for other readers. Its terminal rule denies the request.\nU-09X -> correspondence 1952 duplicate -> tier T2; current for another unit. Its active-damage rule supplies only a digital copy because that unit has a surrogate.\nLater active restrictions control over older condition grades and withdrawn leaves."}
